  "content": "I suppose I would get more reactions if I scolded certain individuals by name.\n\nThat is not my style, and I will not apologize for refusing to do it.\n\nI see so much visceral hatred here now, and I refuse to be drawn into a lynch-mob mentality. Accountability is necessary. Personal degradation, threats, and collective fury are not.\n\n“Be angry and do not sin; do not let the sun go down on your anger.”\n\nI am angry. But my anger does not require me to hate anyone.\n",
